 862	%   21]
 863	% The local Hamiltonian problem for $XZ$-Hamiltonians is QMA-complete.\footnote{In~\cite[Lemma 21]{CM13} this is stated for the $XY$ Hamiltonian, to which $XZ$ is equivalent by local rotation.}
