1333	The proofs of Theorem~\ref{thm:gametwoplayer} and Theorem~\ref{thm:isotwoplayer} are given in Sections~\ref{sec:gametwoplayer} and Section~\ref{sec:istwoplayer} respectively. Before moving to the proofs we state an immediate, but powerful, application of the theorems to the problem of establishing dimension witnesses. For this it is sufficient to note the following well-known fact:
1334	
1335	\begin{fact}
1336	Let $\rho$ be a density matrix on $\C^{\otimes n}\otimes \C^{\otimes n}$ and $\eps > 0 $ such that 
1337	$$ \frac{1}{2^n} \sum_{P\in\{X,Z\}^n} \Tr( (\sigma_P \otimes \sigma_P) \rho ) \geq 1-\eps,$$
1338	where $\sigma_P = \sigma_{P_1} \otimes \cdots \otimes \sigma_{P_n}$. Then 
1339	$$ \bra{\EPR}^{\otimes n} \,\rho\, \ket{\EPR}^{\otimes n} \geq 1-\eps.$$
1340	\end{fact}
