1442	$$\E_{a,b:a\cdot b=0} \Drho(X^A(a){Z^A}(b) -  {Z^A}(b)X^A(a))^2 =O(\delta(\eps_\ac)^{1/2})+ O({\eps_{\stab}}^{1/4}).$$ 
